import Link from"next/link";import{auth}from"@/auth";import{logoutAction}from"@/app/actions";import{getLocale,getMessages}from"@/lib/i18n-server";import{LanguageSwitcher}from"./language-switcher";export async function Header(){const[s,l,m]=await Promise.all([auth(),getLocale(),getMessages()]);return <header><Link className="brand" href="/"><b>NEYROEROS</b></Link><nav><Link href="/categories">{m.categories}</Link><Link href="/stories">Истории</Link><Link href="/search">{m.search}</Link>{s?.user&&<Link href="/dashboard">{m.studio}</Link>}{["ADMIN","MODERATOR"].includes(s?.user.role||"")&&<Link href="/admin">{m.moderation}</Link>}</nav><div><LanguageSwitcher locale={l} label={m.language}/>{s?<form action={logoutAction}><button className="ghost">{m.logout}</button></form>:<Link className="button" href="/login">{m.login}</Link>}</div></header>}
